    ("OWNER_DOC_WRITABLE", "Identity / polyrob / local profile", "OFF (**ON under POLYROB_LOCAL + AUTONOMY_ENABLED**)", "Agent can maintain a bounded owner-facts doc (`owner.md`, ≤1600 chars) injected on the SELF/SOUL seam — durable facts/preferences about the owner. Same quarantine-then-promote + identity-scan model as SELF-context. Agent action `owner_doc_manage`."),
