    ("OWNER_RULES_IMMEDIATE", "Identity / polyrob / local profile", "OFF (`False`)", "a rule written on a GENUINE OWNER TURN applies to the ACTIVE doc immediately (`self_context_manage`/`owner_doc_manage`), instead of landing in `.pending/`, and the reply reports what changed. A FORGED turn (self-wake, delegation result, sub-agent/leaf, autonomous goal run) is st…"),
