    ("DB_PATH", "Identity / polyrob / local profile", "unset (derived: `<data_dir>/database/bot.db`)", "Explicit `bot.db` location (R-2 B2 made it REAL — historically a decoy the app never opened). Unset = the historical derivation, following the CLI's post-construction `data_dir` reassignment. Set = honored, with a refuse-to-guess guard: if the derived location still holds the re…"),
